XM7 net6 gate net7 VGND sg13_lv_nmos w={{dischW}}u l={{dischL}}u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
XM8 net7 gate VGND VGND sg13_lv_nmos w={{dischW}}u l={{dischL}}u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1

